.SH NAME
git-work-bug-deselect - Clear the implicitly selected issue


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-work bug deselect [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Clear the implicitly selected issue


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for deselect


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
git work issue select 2f15
git work issue comment
git work issue status
git work issue deselect

